WEBVTT

00:00.750 --> 00:02.310
What is that?

00:04.140 --> 00:07.270
Quickly, everyone!
Evacuate to the coal mining village!

00:07.650 --> 00:09.400
Marshal, what is that?

00:09.990 --> 00:11.400
It's a Lucasite.

00:11.400 --> 00:14.450
If we stay here, we'll be
destroyed along with the town!

00:18.280 --> 00:19.940
It escaped from us at the beach,

00:19.940 --> 00:21.980
but we have to stop it this time.

00:21.980 --> 00:23.960
It's our time to shine.

00:24.590 --> 00:26.250
I'm not going.

00:31.820 --> 00:32.960
We have to hurry.

00:32.960 --> 00:34.800
It's quickly approaching the town.

00:35.700 --> 00:37.360
Hey, wait!

00:37.870 --> 00:40.350
Mu-chan, are you really not going
to fight with us any more?

00:42.380 --> 00:45.200
I know you'll come with us.

02:11.580 --> 02:13.980
I'll Definitely Defend It!

02:14.260 --> 02:16.650
I'm not letting anything through.

02:16.930 --> 02:19.910
Please, I still have to pay off my loan.

02:25.080 --> 02:26.300
What should I do?

02:26.300 --> 02:29.250
Maybe I'll go home, but...

02:29.250 --> 02:30.160
Bahamut!

02:31.480 --> 02:34.380
Bahamut, I've been worried about you.

02:40.920 --> 02:43.050
You read it, didn't you?

02:47.140 --> 02:50.210
Nothing can change the fact
that you're my daughter.

02:50.930 --> 02:54.230
Come, you must evacuate with
the rest of the townsfolk.

02:56.240 --> 02:57.030
Um...

02:57.300 --> 03:00.000
I must protect this town.

03:00.710 --> 03:01.800
Do you understand?

03:13.920 --> 03:14.960
Fire!

03:17.970 --> 03:18.950
It's not working.

03:21.370 --> 03:22.340
Wyvern!

03:23.420 --> 03:25.370
Cockatrice, be careful!

03:25.370 --> 03:26.390
Leave it to me.

03:31.980 --> 03:33.100
Petrify!

03:38.170 --> 03:39.190
It's not working at all.

03:40.770 --> 03:41.700
Cockatrice!

03:51.260 --> 03:54.320
It looks like we'll have to transform
if we want to stop it here.

03:54.320 --> 03:55.040
Yeah.

03:55.250 --> 03:56.480
Hold on.

03:56.480 --> 03:58.800
Why don't we wait for Bahamut?

03:59.110 --> 04:01.130
What? Under these conditions?

04:01.360 --> 04:06.030
I know, but I'm sure she'll come.

04:06.030 --> 04:08.060
I'm sure Bahamut will come.

04:08.580 --> 04:12.560
But while we wait, the Lucasite
is rapidly approaching the town.

04:14.500 --> 04:17.630
Oh, right. This is just the
time to summon the guardians.

04:17.630 --> 04:20.230
Leviatan, let's summon Yurlungur.

04:22.180 --> 04:25.030
Very well. Give me a sphere, Syrop.

04:25.030 --> 04:26.200
I don't have one.

04:28.720 --> 04:30.200
Don't joke around!

04:30.550 --> 04:31.450
Sorry.

04:31.790 --> 04:35.460
Are you saying you could summon
a guardian if you had a sphere?

04:36.330 --> 04:37.960
Use this, then.

04:38.310 --> 04:40.970
You're Bahamut's father.

04:40.970 --> 04:42.930
Your name is Syrop, isn't it?

04:43.560 --> 04:44.420
Here.

04:44.420 --> 04:45.470
Thank you.

04:49.580 --> 04:53.390
Yurlungur, lend us your strength!

05:01.580 --> 05:03.360
Defeat the Lucasite!

05:11.890 --> 05:13.040
All right!

05:17.170 --> 05:18.100
No!

05:19.130 --> 05:20.070
Barrier!

05:29.870 --> 05:31.810
You can create a barrier!

05:32.040 --> 05:36.140
Yes, but I've never faced such
a massive opponent before.

05:39.800 --> 05:41.260
Yurlungur!

05:48.780 --> 05:51.050
Yurlungur returned to his swamp.

05:51.520 --> 05:54.900
But while Mu-chan's dad is
keeping that barrier up,

05:54.900 --> 05:57.540
maybe we can do something.

05:57.540 --> 05:59.540
You're right. Let's give it a shot.

05:59.690 --> 06:00.770
You can't.

06:02.170 --> 06:03.880
The two of you alone can't win.

06:04.180 --> 06:05.060
But...

06:07.350 --> 06:08.510
You...

06:16.060 --> 06:17.970
Who was that boy?

06:20.970 --> 06:23.640
If we don't stay sharp, it'll get back up!

06:23.640 --> 06:24.570
Jörm!

06:27.070 --> 06:29.820
I'll see what I can do with
this until Mu-chan shows up.

06:31.090 --> 06:33.080
Me, too.

06:47.770 --> 06:49.170
Those girls...

06:49.840 --> 06:51.130
That was close.

06:51.130 --> 06:53.700
We need to get this to
Jörm, no matter what.

06:53.700 --> 06:56.780
Those girls can summon
a guardian with this.

06:57.220 --> 07:00.140
Papa Travis has been carefully
holding onto this sphere.

07:02.580 --> 07:04.650
My dads took me in.

07:04.910 --> 07:07.320
We're our dads' children, too.

07:08.880 --> 07:10.000
Wait.

07:10.000 --> 07:11.570
It's Mu-chan.

07:11.570 --> 07:13.600
It's Mu-chan, it's Mu-chan.

07:13.600 --> 07:16.500
We're on our way to get this to Jörm.

07:16.500 --> 07:18.040
Mu-chan, where's Jörm?

07:19.210 --> 07:20.860
I'll take it to her.

07:20.860 --> 07:23.080
You should evacuate to the coal mines.

07:23.080 --> 07:24.790
We'll fight, too.

07:25.010 --> 07:26.120
You mustn't!

07:26.120 --> 07:28.930
That monster is really strong and dangerous.

07:29.600 --> 07:31.550
Leave it to us.

07:31.780 --> 07:33.570
You can defeat it?

07:34.770 --> 07:39.060
Don't worry. We're the Aquafall Defense.

07:40.550 --> 07:42.440
So cool!

07:42.440 --> 07:46.210
You can do it! You can do it, Mu-chan!

08:00.260 --> 08:01.120
Water,

08:04.080 --> 08:05.370
rip it to pieces!

08:15.100 --> 08:17.940
He's so hard. Even his stomach's rock solid.

08:22.240 --> 08:24.100
No way...

08:39.530 --> 08:40.890
Are you all right?

08:43.580 --> 08:44.940
Are you okay?

08:44.940 --> 08:47.330
I'm fine. However...

08:48.270 --> 08:50.630
The barrier has been destroyed.

08:56.890 --> 08:58.850
I'm transforming.

08:58.850 --> 09:00.100
Good idea.

09:01.730 --> 09:04.040
Where is Bahamut?

09:04.040 --> 09:05.730
I'm right here.

09:09.170 --> 09:11.110
Thanks for waiting, everyone.

09:11.440 --> 09:13.580
Bahamut, what are you doing here?

09:14.280 --> 09:16.450
It's all right, Father.

09:16.450 --> 09:20.270
We've fought plenty of times before.

09:20.900 --> 09:22.750
We're pretty strong.

09:23.440 --> 09:26.370
From now on, I'll protect you.

09:27.700 --> 09:29.920
My dads and sisters...

09:30.390 --> 09:32.420
A place for my brother to return to...

09:33.060 --> 09:34.950
We will protect them!

10:20.720 --> 10:23.670
I got this from your sisters.

10:23.670 --> 10:25.100
Can I use it?

10:25.560 --> 10:26.930
My sisters?

10:27.790 --> 10:31.110
Yeah, sure. Call the master of the volcano.

10:31.410 --> 10:32.480
Thanks.

10:32.790 --> 10:34.020
All right!

10:35.670 --> 10:36.700
Oh, no!

10:36.700 --> 10:37.590
Mu-chan!

10:39.690 --> 10:41.570
Wait!

10:43.080 --> 10:47.630
If only it had broken,
I could've summoned him.

10:48.830 --> 10:50.120
The sphere!

10:57.090 --> 10:59.170
We can't get close
enough to the sphere.

10:59.530 --> 11:01.550
That light is in our way.

11:04.170 --> 11:04.930
Levi!

11:06.340 --> 11:10.020
Onii-chan, what can I do?

11:13.320 --> 11:15.690
Bahamut, go!

11:15.690 --> 11:17.070
I will protect you!

11:19.610 --> 11:21.420
Levi-tan, nice.

11:28.420 --> 11:29.540
Good.

11:29.960 --> 11:33.750
Okay. Come on out, Fire Drake!

11:40.690 --> 11:42.860
Burn the Lucasite.

11:46.850 --> 11:47.850
My turn.

11:48.300 --> 11:49.870
Flare of the sun,

11:51.180 --> 11:54.840
show yourself and obey me!

12:08.630 --> 12:13.930
Water of Aquafall, lend me your strength!

12:16.910 --> 12:19.630
It's as though Aquafall is floating.

12:20.640 --> 12:22.780
I will protect this planet.

12:35.000 --> 12:35.880
Jörm!

12:36.860 --> 12:38.820
Hit it as hard as you can with your axe!

13:00.870 --> 13:02.790
Well done, Levi.

13:03.200 --> 13:06.030
You were the only one who
could do this, Levi.

13:06.550 --> 13:09.550
I know. Onii-chan, I...

13:35.770 --> 13:37.120
Um...

13:37.870 --> 13:40.210
Bahamut, are you hurt?

13:40.760 --> 13:42.270
I'm fine.

13:44.120 --> 13:45.160
I...

13:45.990 --> 13:50.750
Bahamut, you have always
been my daughter.

13:51.400 --> 13:52.870
Is that not what you want?

13:55.020 --> 13:56.240
No...

13:57.500 --> 14:01.530
No! I don't want to be
anyone but your daughter!

14:14.070 --> 14:17.330
Syrop, I'm joining the Aquafall Defense.

14:17.330 --> 14:18.170
What?

14:18.460 --> 14:21.340
What is this defense force you speak of?

14:22.100 --> 14:24.280
It's the Aquafall Defense.

14:24.280 --> 14:28.340
I'm going on a journey with these
people to protect the planet.

14:28.340 --> 14:29.310
What?

14:29.760 --> 14:32.180
I love you, Father.

14:32.640 --> 14:35.980
That is why in order to protect you...

14:35.980 --> 14:39.850
...and the town of Haruna you keep safe,

14:39.850 --> 14:42.490
I'm going on a journey with my friends.

14:44.480 --> 14:46.860
Have you already made up your mind?

14:47.860 --> 14:48.740
Yes.

14:49.540 --> 14:50.510
I see.

14:51.740 --> 14:54.590
I am proud to call you my daughter.

14:56.350 --> 14:57.340
Mu-chan.

15:00.250 --> 15:05.070
Don't call me that when we're
having a serious conversation.

15:09.150 --> 15:11.260
Syrop, everyone.

15:11.450 --> 15:12.510
What is it?

15:13.100 --> 15:16.670
I will join the Aquafall Defense, as well.

15:16.670 --> 15:20.390
I will fight with you to protect this planet.

15:21.350 --> 15:25.400
Really? Thank you, Leviatan. Thank you.

15:25.400 --> 15:29.660
The Aquafall Defense has finally formed!

15:35.750 --> 15:39.410
I wish you would continue
protecting the town.

15:40.140 --> 15:43.870
But isn't the planet still in a terrible
state because of the monsters...

15:43.870 --> 15:46.000
...pouring out from the meteorites?

15:46.000 --> 15:50.000
We live on this planet.
We must protect it ourselves.

15:51.360 --> 15:53.430
Now is the time to make our stand!

15:53.870 --> 15:57.430
I see. Give it your best, for us.

15:58.500 --> 16:02.070
Chief, we will protect this town.

16:02.070 --> 16:03.240
We will.

16:04.320 --> 16:07.490
Jörm, we're going with you.

16:07.490 --> 16:09.870
Metal, Rudra, Ragon.

16:09.870 --> 16:12.990
Look after our dads for me.

16:14.320 --> 16:16.870
She asked us to take
care of our dads.

16:17.200 --> 16:20.370
Miss, please be careful
on your journey.

16:20.920 --> 16:22.260
I'll see you later.

16:22.880 --> 16:25.000
I'll miss you.

16:25.000 --> 16:26.440
I'm sorry.

16:26.440 --> 16:29.510
I've decided to look for my
brother while we travel.

16:29.770 --> 16:30.900
I see.

16:30.900 --> 16:35.010
I'll fix my store by the time you return.

16:35.100 --> 16:38.470
Let's go!

16:50.610 --> 16:55.030
You'll protect this planet, won't you?

16:55.030 --> 16:57.530
It's that mysterious boy again.

16:57.530 --> 16:59.050
Who are you?

16:59.910 --> 17:01.580
What do you know?

17:02.360 --> 17:07.040
I know your journey will
be long and difficult.

17:07.380 --> 17:10.550
This planet is in grave trouble.

17:11.040 --> 17:13.880
You mean it's full of Eibolias?

17:13.880 --> 17:16.990
What? Leviatan, where
did you hear that name?

17:16.990 --> 17:19.050
My brother told me in a dream.

17:19.600 --> 17:21.810
Oh, so you already know.

17:22.390 --> 17:25.400
That's why we formed a defense force.

17:25.400 --> 17:26.810
Why don't you tell us?

17:27.030 --> 17:30.320
But you're not nearly strong enough yet.

17:30.320 --> 17:32.820
How rude. You just watch.

17:33.760 --> 17:35.070
I look forward to it.

17:35.070 --> 17:38.320
You must protect the pillars of the world.

17:38.590 --> 17:40.550
What a cheeky kid.

17:40.550 --> 17:42.330
Come on, everyone. Let's go.

17:46.520 --> 17:48.250
The pillars? Huh?

17:48.250 --> 17:49.950
Syrorin, what's wrong?

17:49.950 --> 17:52.500
He's gone. He's so quick.

17:53.390 --> 17:56.440
Huh? She didn't react even
though you called her Syrorin.

17:56.440 --> 17:57.630
She must have accepted it.

17:57.630 --> 17:59.430
No, that's not it!

17:59.430 --> 18:01.510
My name isn't Syrorin!

18:05.830 --> 18:08.570
Syrop, you're always hungry.

18:36.120 --> 18:38.820
The pillars are the keystone.

18:39.500 --> 18:44.520
Seventy and two, they support
the foundation of the world.

18:46.030 --> 18:50.730
The gods protecting the
keystone are seventy and two.

18:51.360 --> 18:54.730
Their forms are like illusions.

20:14.880 --> 20:19.500
Fin
